/-!
# A161901

Array read by rows in which row n lists the divisors of n, but if n is a square then the square root of n appears twice.

The 74 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

